{
  "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye",
  "chapter": 4,
  "act": 4,
  "scene": "yuanye",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "songhuizhen",
    "liqinghe"
  ],
  "require": {
    "flag.enthroned": false
  },
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "允许今晚只有吃饼，不替明日领新职责",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "暮色落尽，你带着入园前买的胡饼，油纸还暖，芝麻香从折口透出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye.l2",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我只吃自己的。你别又分一半过来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye.l3",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我买多了？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye.l4",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "一张。还没吃，你先担心这个。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye.l5",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你掰开饼，热气散在袖边，最脆的一角掉进掌心。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye.l6",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "明日若还是没有定呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye.l7",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "明日照样先吃饭，钱用自己的，住处照旧；没有人等你为这一张饼另立一条章程。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye.l8",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你今日这么闲？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye.l9",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我的交完了，正要回去。别人还没交的，也不能又从我这半夜里扣。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye.l10",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "宋拿起自己的那一份，去找来时的门，没有问你往后打算。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_together": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我那边说完了。这里还坐得下么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_together": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "来。饼要自己拿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_together": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她坐在旁边的石阶，先把自己的外衣垫好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye.l14",
      "when": {
        "flag.liqinghe_together": false
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你把油纸铺在膝上，慢慢吃完，没有留下一个等人来坐的地方。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye.l15",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "一张便够了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s10_yuanye.l16",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "夜风吹到指尖，你将碎屑拢进油纸，没有再去买第二张。"
    }
  ],
  "goto": "ch04_s17_nvguan"
}
